KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
BUSINESS - Financial Accounting (Year 2024)

Q1. Under the fundamental balance sheet equation, which relationship holds true?
  (A) Assets = Liabilities + Owner's Equity
  (B) Assets = Liabilities - Owner's Equity
  (C) Equity = Assets + Liabilities
  (D) Net Income = Revenue + Expenses
  Answer: A - The fundamental accounting equation is Assets = Liabilities + Owner's Equity.


